cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Cytometry UMAP
abstract: A seeded, reproducible two-dimensional UMAP embedding of the per-sample cell subsample written
  by the FlowSOM step, with maps of the cells coloured by metacluster label, condition, batch and the
  expression of every marker.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
